<title>UK: London gold closes weaker after slide below $350.</title>
<headline>London gold closes weaker after slide below $350.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes sharply lower at $350.90/$351.40 vs $353.40/$353.90 previously. Bounced off lows after trading below $350, but still vulnerable to downside.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends just one cent down at $4.71/$4.73 after early dip.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closes at $355.95/$356.95, down $1.80 with gold.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends steady at $0.50 lower $120.75/$121.75.</p>
</text>
